*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
